{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-pnw-loam-pedals-gen-2-2603-0144","content_id":"3bb2385d-efc1-412f-adfe-c5491fa85aa2","description":"Product Recall for PNW Loam Pedals Gen 2 presenting a serious risk of injuries.","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"9570ffc0-3d62-4d14-ad95-54a29beddba1","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-03-18T18:24:41+00:00","id":"9570ffc0-3d62-4d14-ad95-54a29beddba1","title":"Link to product image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-03-18T18:24:41+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69baede8511897e6c6fd61eb/2603-0144-product-recall-PNW-loam-pedal-gen-2.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: PNW Loam Pedals Gen 2</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious risk of injuries as the pedal axles can crack and fail during use.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action: The product has been recalled from end users by PNW.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Hobby/sports equipment - Cycle Parts - Pedal</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>PNW</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Affected SKUs</td>\n      <td>PD-LM2-TEC-BLK-BLK PD-LM2-TEC-PNW-LT PD-LM2-TEC-BLD-OR PD-LM2-TEC-MSS-GR PD-LM2-TEC-FRT-SN</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>United States</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Aluminium alloy mountain bike pedal in the platform style (non-clip). The product has the “Tectonic logo etched onto the pedal body on the left corner, on the same side as the threaded axle. The pedals were sold in silver, black, orange, purple, and green colours.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_9570ffc0-3d62-4d14-ad95-54a29beddba1\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/69baede8511897e6c6fd61eb/2603-0144-product-recall-PNW-loam-pedal-gen-2.pdf\">Link to product image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious risk of injuries as the pedal axles can crack during use. This may cause the pedal to detach unexpectedly from the crank arm, posing a fall and injury hazard to the user.</p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of the General Product Safety Regulations 2005.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been recalled from end users by PNW.\nWe recommend that you stop using the product immediately. PNW have contacted some affected users directly. If you have not received an email, or purchased your pedals through a retailer, please contact <a href=\"mailto:info@marchesparts.co.uk\">info@marchesparts.co.uk</a> to register for replacement pedals.</p>\n\n<p>For more information, please access: <a rel=\"external\" href=\"https://pnwcomponents.co.uk/pages/voluntary-recall-loam-pedal-gen-2?srsltid=AfmBOoo3KVj1eWWwt-hEL74EVkWN3VDnMPbimC0feasYj3YtIS-W6D4h\">https://pnwcomponents.co.uk/pages/voluntary-recall-loam-pedal-gen-2</a></p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2603-0144</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-03-18T18:25:10Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-recall","product_category":"hobby-sports-equipment","product_measure_type":["recall-of-product-from-end-users"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-03-18","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-03-18T18:25:10+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-pnw-loam-pedals-gen-2-2603-0144","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-pnw-loam-pedals-gen-2-2603-0144","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-pnw-loam-pedals-gen-2-2603-0144","content_id":"3bb2385d-efc1-412f-adfe-c5491fa85aa2","document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-03-18T18:25:10Z","schema_name":"specialist_document","title":"Product Recall: PNW Loam Pedals Gen 2 (2603-0144)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-recall-pnw-loam-pedals-gen-2-2603-0144","withdrawn":false}],"finder":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls","content_id":"a22b3f1f-2c91-49a1-a469-ff21d465c543","details":{"facets":[{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Product safety alert","value":"product-safety-alert"},{"label":"Product safety report","value":"product-safety-report"},{"label":"Product recall","value":"product-recall"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_alert_type","name":"Alert type","preposition":"of type","short_name":"Alert type","type":"text"},{"allowed_values":[{"label":"Serious","value":"serious"},{"label":"High","value":"high"},{"label":"Medium","value":"medium"},{"label":"Low","value":"low"},{"label":"Not provided","value":"not-provided"}],"display_as_result_metadata":true,"filterable":true,"key":"product_risk_level","name":"Risk level","preposition":"that are",